float    wvHsMid = NAN, wvTzMid = NAN; // heave Hs moved to midships and its peak period (v8.0; NaN without the VMR's position in card 15)
// Heave at midships (v8.0): the hull is rigid, so the VMR rises and falls with the heave at
// midships plus x * pitch - y * roll (x forward, y to starboard of midships on the centreline;
// pitch + bow up, roll + starboard down, small angles). Taken off per frequency from the complex
// spectra of each segment: Zmid = A / -(2 pi f)^2 - x * Pitch + y * Roll.
float  (*wvCx)[2][WV_K1 + 1] = nullptr;   // this segment's complex spectra [acceleration, pitch][re, im] - heap
